riscos-gtk's changes to AbiWord 3.0.8 (after Debian's, ./abiword-3.0.8-debian):
- no X11: configure.ac doesn't ask for x11; ap_UnixApp.cpp parses
  --geometry itself instead of XParseGeometry (ABI_RISCOS).
- xap_UnixFrameImpl.cpp: a window's zoom updater (an idle) is removed
  when the window goes, whatever m_bDoZoomUpdate says (it crashed on a
  window closed just after a resize).
- ev_UnixMenu.cpp: a submenu whose label is missing gets an unseen menu
  for its items, so its end doesn't pop its parent (crashed building the
  menu bar); the Log names the menu.
- xap_UnixDlg_About.cpp: the About box's logo is the icon theme's
  "abiword", as the windows' icon (ICONDIR is where AbiWord was built).
- plugins/mathview (equations): built in, as the other plugins here (plugin.m4,
  Makefile.am), registered as abipgn_mathview_register (the folder's name).
